 kit work - starts or resumes work on issues

   one of required
   <reference>  the issues, each named with its tracker: 7, #7, or AB#4521; the first is the
                primary, and the one pull request closes them all
   --title      creates an issue with that title and starts it; with references, creates it as their
                parent, as kit gather does, and starts it with them
   --pr         adds the issues to one of the caller's own open pull requests instead: each is
                assigned to the caller and closed by it


 kit work
